   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"D", "[", 
     RowBox[{"lin", ",", " ", "dpS"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "Together"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[47]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5a5a75cb-e13e-4a83-b672-548ee22505ff"],

Cell["\<\
Two structural facts, both needed later. The gauge field has no x component, \
so the radial electric field F^{zx} vanishes and the boundary current has j^x \
= 0 identically. And zc^2 N^2 tends to l4^2 at the boundary: the lapse is \
asymptotically l4/z, so the square root defining N peels off as a rational \
series in z with leading coefficient one -- no Sqrt monster survives into the \
expansion. (Corpus lesson: peel the perfect square by hand.)\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9848177e-9d4e-4874-b855-1b7f492556b6"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"D", "[", 
    RowBox[{"lin", ",", " ", "dxS"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Together", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["z", "2"], " ", "N2Ex"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
     RowBox[{"z", " ", "->", " ", "0"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[50]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f3d6a9c0-8a67-4ae8-8299-15e471c3b288"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"0", ",", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    InterpretationBox[
     StyleBox["l4",
      ShowAutoStyles->False,
      AutoSpacing->False],
     $CellContext`l4,
     Editable->False], "2"]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.996914875758256*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[50]=",ExpressionUUID->"b74e7a23-9f2c-4981-a83d-379119ba8c5f"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Holographic renormalisation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"9bf53600-65e7-4939-8001-2d4cdcf71d00"],

Cell["\<\
The renormalised boundary stress tensor of Balasubramanian-Kraus, paper eq. \
(3.11): T_ij = (1/8 pi G4) lim (1/eps)[-K_ij + h_ij K - 2 h_ij + R_ij(h) - \
(1/2) h_ij R(h)]. The bracket is exactly what the corpus obtains by varying \
the boundary action, so the construction of Sol__3dL__Induced-black-hole__FG \
is reused verbatim: vary sqrt(-h)(K - 2/l4 - (l4/2) R(h)) with respect to the \
inverse induced metric and add K_ij back. The l4-restored counterterm \
coefficients are 2/l4 and l4/2 (the paper sets l = 1).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e27db284-3757-4b8c-81c1-b6fb177db1d0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SqrtBox[
     RowBox[{"-", 
      RowBox[{"Detgg", "[", "]"}]}]], " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"EK", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\[ScriptM]", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "\[ScriptM]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", "/", "l4"}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"l4", "/", "2"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"RicciScalarcd", "[", "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "//", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SeparateMetric", "[", "gg", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"stress\[UnderBracket]energy", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"2", "/", 
            SqrtBox[
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{"Detgg", "[", "]"}]}]]}], ")"}]}], " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"VarD", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"gg", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\[ScriptM]", ",", " ", "\[ScriptN]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            "cd"}], "]"}], "[", "%", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
