Cell["\<\
THE EXTRACTION, in two stages. Stage one is formal: each abstract slice \
function is replaced by a Laurent ansatz in zc with SMALL FORMAL COEFFICIENT \
HEADS htt0[x], htt1[x], ... and the bracket is expanded in series. Every \
coefficient of the resulting Laurent expansion is then a compact formula in \
those heads -- the algebra never sees the seven-parameter rationals. Stage \
two substitutes the actual coefficients, obtained from ONE cheap Series per \
slice function, into those formulas.

Note the per-object series orders below. Requesting a fixed order everywhere \
is wrong: the inverse metric starts at zc^2 and the extrinsic curvature at \
zc^-2, so a uniform request truncates some objects below the order the \
bracket needs and Mathematica's validity window then silently collapses the \
answer to zero. The orders {3, 5, 2, 1, 3} are the smallest that leave the \
bracket valid through order zc^1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0055e60d-4e9f-48d2-b480-9a2eaaa9cb84"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"fS", "[", 
    RowBox[{"b_", ",", " ", "k_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Symbol", "[", 
    RowBox[{"b", " ", "<>", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "k", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"formalSub", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"htt", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"Function", " ", "@@", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"z", ",", " ", "xx"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sum", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"fS", "[", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<htt\>\"", ",", " ", "k"}], "]"}], "[", "xx", 
               "]"}], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["z", "k"]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "5"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "/", 
           SuperscriptBox["z", "2"]}]}], "}"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"htp", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"Function", " ", "@@", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
