Cell["\<\
The two divergent orders of the bracket must vanish for the counterterms to \
have done their job. They do, for every component and with l4 kept general -- \
this is the holographic renormalisation of the accelerating solution in \
ADM-with-shift slicing, which is not a case the corpus had covered. The \
finite order is 8 pi G4 T_ij.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6fbc8e29-fec2-420c-8e07-d01f8a0aae90"],

