Cell["\<\
The boundary metric is the zeroth coefficient of eps^2 h_ij, paper eq. (3.7); \
its inverse raises the stress tensor index. The trace must vanish -- and \
does, symbolically. A vanishing trace could be vacuous if the components \
themselves were zero, so the two largest components are checked to be nonzero \
at the same time.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"932e22c7-7bd4-4157-85bd-e619a2fffd28"],

