Cell["\<\
The electric current, paper eq. (3.12): j^i = -(1/4 pi G4) lim (1/eps^3) n_mu \
F^{mu i}, with n the outward unit normal of the ADM decomposition. In terms \
of the slice data the normal contributes the lapse and the inverse bulk \
metric components G^zz = 1/N^2 and G^zx = -N^x/N^2. There is no j^x because A \
has no x component.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cda36950-6258-47a9-a1a6-de11620f2519"],

