Cell["\<\
Comparison with the paper. Equation (3.12) is typed verbatim -- the paper's \
variable x is cos theta, which is minus the chart scalar x[] of this corpus, \
but the current happens to involve only even powers of it, so the expressions \
are directly comparable. Both components agree exactly at l = 1; the stored \
versions carry the l4 and kappa restored.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"675c10f6-65f0-4e3f-88a8-d84838d5b524"],

